        "B": "-1",
        "C": "cot² A",
        "D": "tan² A"
      },
      "answer": "D",
      "explanation": "Simplifies to tan² A.",
      "hash": "87cbf22dcae51a89",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "(1 + tan² A) / (1 + cot² A) बराबर है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "sec² A",
            "B": "-1",
            "C": "cot² A",
            "D": "tan² A"
          },
          "explanation": "sec² A / cosec² A = (1/cos²) / (1/sin²) = sin²/cos² = tan² A।"
